        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Add participants and scope",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "都 normally comes before the predicate and covers the relevant group. 也 adds a parallel fact; 还 adds or continues something; 再 marks a later repetition.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们都喝茶。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen dōu hē chá 。",
                "meaning": "We all drink tea.",
                "audio": "83709edeca3e56c0fbb035a907dd8fdde862e3d2120fdff8a93d0581e6edd374"
              },
              {
                "text": "我也喝茶。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yě hē chá 。",
                "meaning": "I drink tea too.",
                "audio": "f98f72bba6b86595a36b316dfaa2d037011b8bcd0674ae697fd8f4367ce6a51e"
              },
              {
                "text": "我还要水。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ hái yào shuǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I also want water.",
                "audio": "7158380ec6d76c79f5fde9482e1a6f85fbaeeb00d9ef1afad4f319fabd141bcc"
              },
              {
                "text": "明天再来。",
